Package: netmatchRI
Title: Network-Constrained Matching and Randomization Inference
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zhejia", "Dong", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "zhejia_dong@brown.edu"),
    person("Youjin", "Lee", role = "aut")
  )
Author: Zhejia Dong [aut, cre], Youjin Lee [aut]
Maintainer: Zhejia Dong <zhejia_dong@brown.edu>
Description: Tools for matching observational data with network dependence
    and testing sharp null hypotheses by randomization inference. The package
    centers on a dual-penalty matched design that excludes close treated-control
    pairs and close same-arm units within matched sets. It also includes
    comparison matching designs, model-assisted variance bounds, sensitivity
    grids, a critical sensitivity curve, and a built-in 300-unit
    example dataset.
